# The Python pipeline is run from disk on every spawn (cwd = src-tauri), so nothing under
# src-python needs a Rust rebuild: code edits apply on the next run, and downloads (models,
# venvs, ComfyUI, FFmpeg, caches) must not restart `tauri dev` and kill a render in progress.
src-python/**

# Runtime output written next to the Rust crate
data/**
logs/**
services/**
assets/**

# Blanket ignore all log files anywhere in the src-tauri directory just in case
**/*.log
